|passage=Interviews, clippings, '''yellowing''' stories from foreign newspapers, notebooks with old scribblings. Salisbury called it the debris of a reporter always too much on the run to sort out the paper, but there it was, an investigator's dream, {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make (something) yellow or more yellow.

